## Interface: 11509, 16001, 20506
## Title: Guidelime for Polestar
## Notes: Plays Guidelime guides in Polestar: every installed Guidelime guide addon, Guidelime's own custom guides and guides you paste in. /glp
## Version: 1.0.0
## Author: Kiet
## Dependencies: Polestar
## OptionalDeps: Guidelime
## SavedVariables: GLPolestarDB

# The folder name sorts before "Guidelime_*", so this addon loads (after Guidelime,
# its optional dependency) before the guide addons and catches their guides.
Zones.lua
Convert.lua
Core.lua
Import.lua
